## 8. Other Conserved Genes

Other notable conserved genes identified in the annotation include:

- ***matK*** — associated with plastid gene expression and commonly used in plant molecular studies.
- ***clpP*** — encodes a component of the chloroplast proteolytic system.
- ***accD*** — involved in fatty-acid biosynthesis.
- ***cemA*** — associated with chloroplast envelope functions.
- ***ycf1*** — conserved plastid gene with an important role in chloroplast function.
- ***ycf2*** — one of the largest conserved plastid genes.
- ***ycf3*** — associated with Photosystem I assembly.
- ***ycf4*** — associated with photosynthetic complex assembly.

